{"2799120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Show edition 17", "steam_appid": 2799120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/f6e3dd6ab63753848fc8b1984f4ad85b.webp?t=1786409757\" width=340 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/0b57d32feeccb25010679f329f64877d.poster.avif?t=1786409757\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/0b57d32feeccb25010679f329f64877d.webm?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/0b57d32feeccb25010679f329f64877d.mp4?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Show is a fast-paced space shoot’em up playable solo or in co-op, blending arcade action with roguelite progression. Defend Earth against waves of asteroids and enemy fleets, upgrade your equipment between runs, and adapt your strategy to survive longer and longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/660124b7ee2c46010f927e693b4d5256.webp?t=1786409757\" width=402 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/922f065a1d34e11e02df0f065af2233d.poster.avif?t=1786409757\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/922f065a1d34e11e02df0f065af2233d.webm?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/922f065a1d34e11e02df0f065af2233d.mp4?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push back increasingly dangerous waves of enemies. Destroy swarms of asteroids, survive against massive enemy armadas, and try to beat the world’s best scores in ever more intense battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/24e76cc6eb7978a204068b306cd03141.webp?t=1786409757\" width=390 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/311fc3776eb8cd7cd7ff339236a4ff90.poster.avif?t=1786409757\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/311fc3776eb8cd7cd7ff339236a4ff90.webm?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/311fc3776eb8cd7cd7ff339236a4ff90.mp4?t=1786409757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and upgrade your arsenal throughout your runs.<br>Choose from several ship manufacturers with unique playstyles and create combinations that match the way you play.<br>Select and upgrade planetary defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly 30 million possible equipment combinations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799120/extras/6552825003e18f7e367b291be4562999.webp?t=1786409757\" width=363 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c